<title>FINLAND: SAMPO TO JOIN BOOK-ENTRY SYSTEM SEPT 12.</title>
<headline>SAMPO TO JOIN BOOK-ENTRY SYSTEM SEPT 12.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish insurer Sampo Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it had decided to enter its shares to the automatic book-entry system on September 12 this year.</p>
<p>Shareholders would be notified in April, it said.</p>
<p>An extraordinary shareholders meeting decided in December that Sampo will join the system.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
